message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Maxwell Bloch Studio: a desktop application for Maxwell-Bloch models of astronomical masers"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anari
    given-names: Vahid
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2464-3989"
version: 10.7.4
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vahid-anari/maxwell-bloch-studio"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23487624
url: "https://pypi.org/project/maxwell-bloch-studio/"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for interactive Maxwell-Bloch modelling of astronomical
  masers and superradiance: set the sample, pump, relaxation times and boundary
  field with sliders, see the light curve update, and fit observed maser flux
  data. The numerical solver is mbsolver (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23407483).
keywords:
  - Maxwell-Bloch equations
  - masers
  - superradiance
  - astrophysics
  - light curves
  - PySide6
